1:["$","main",null,{"className":"site-main page-dev-responsibility","id":"main","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"page-heading","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"mycmux 開発者向け"}],["$","h1",null,{"children":"立ち位置と約束"}],"$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"dev-nav","aria-label":"開発者向けページの中の移動","children":[["$","a",null,{"className":"dev-nav-root","href":"/dev","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"開発者向け"}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","/dev/boundary",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/boundary","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"境界"}]}],["$","li","/dev/editor",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/editor","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"エディタ本体"}]}],["$","li","/dev/observation",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/observation","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"観測とカード"}]}],["$","li","/dev/dispatch",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/dispatch","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"ディスパッチ"}]}],["$","li","/dev/resume",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/resume","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"resume"}]}],["$","li","/dev/house",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/house","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"エージェントの家"}]}],["$","li","/dev/subsystems",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/subsystems","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"周辺の仕組み"}]}],["$","li","/dev/runtime",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/runtime","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"いま動いているもの"}]}],["$","li","/dev/plans",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/plans","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"設計文書と実装"}]}],["$","li","/dev/responsibility",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/responsibility","aria-current":"page","children":"立ち位置と約束"}]}],["$","li","/dev/glossary",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/glossary","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"用語"}]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"intro","children":[["$","div","0",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<div class=\"callout accent\"><p>mycmux は、複数のエージェント製品をペインで並べて動かすターミナルワークスペースです。安全な操作、状態の観測、委譲に伴う記録を、共通の制御 API で出します。エージェントの内部の実行ループや、仕事の分け方と評価の基準は持ちません。</p><p>原則は、次の一行にまとめられます。</p><p>「本体は操作と記録の整合を守り、アダプターは対応する機能と制約を申告し、skill は仕事の進め方を選び、利用者は判断の基準と許可を与える」</p><p>どの部品も、自分で確かめられない結果を「保証した」とは言いません。作者はこれを、2026-09-25 に設計の記録（ADR 0014）として決めました。</p></div>\n<p>ここまでの 9 ページの調査で、mycmux が自分の外側の仕組みと両方向に依存していることが分かりました。このページでは、その結果を受けて作者が決めた立ち位置と語、5 つの領域、ルール、受け渡しの約束、移す順番を説明します。最後に、調査で見つかった既知の問題と直し方の候補 22 件を載せています。</p>"}}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"reading-layout","children":[["$","$Le",null,{"sections":[{"id":"why","title":"9 月 24 日の原則を置き換えた理由"},{"id":"principle","title":"5 つの領域"},{"id":"split","title":"本体と skill の受け持ち"},{"id":"rules","title":"ルール（10 本）"},{"id":"ids","title":"識別子と状態"},{"id":"agents","title":"エージェントごとの差"},{"id":"contracts","title":"受け渡しの約束（16 本）"},{"id":"verdicts","title":"いまの機能の行き先"},{"id":"steps","title":"移す順番"},{"id":"issues","title":"決めたこと（7 件）"},{"id":"open","title":"まだ決めていない論点"},{"id":"unverified","title":"要確認（7 件）"},{"id":"fixes","title":"既知の問題と直し方の候補（22 件）"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"reading-article","children":[["$","details",null,{"className":"mobile-contents","children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":"このページの目次"}],["$","nav",null,{"aria-label":"このページの目次","children":["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","why",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#why","children":"9 月 24 日の原則を置き換えた理由"}]}],["$","li","principle",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#principle","children":"5 つの領域"}]}],["$","li","split",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#split","children":"本体と skill の受け持ち"}]}],["$","li","rules",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#rules","children":"ルール（10 本）"}]}],["$","li","ids",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#ids","children":"識別子と状態"}]}],["$","li","agents",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#agents","children":"エージェントごとの差"}]}],["$","li","contracts",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#contracts","children":"受け渡しの約束（16 本）"}]}],["$","li","verdicts",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#verdicts","children":"いまの機能の行き先"}]}],["$","li","steps",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#steps","children":"移す順番"}]}],["$","li","issues",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#issues","children":"決めたこと（7 件）"}]}],["$","li","open",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#open","children":"まだ決めていない論点"}]}],["$","li","unverified",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#unverified","children":"要確認（7 件）"}]}],["$","li","fixes",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#fixes","children":"既知の問題と直し方の候補（22 件）"}]}]]}]}]]}],["$","article",null,{"children":[["$","section","why",{"id":"why","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"9 月 24 日の原則を置き換えた理由"}],[["$","div","0",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>9 月 24 日の版は、原則を「アプリはペインの実行、観測、表示を受け持ち、ハーネスは仕事の流れと方針を受け持つ」としていました。ここでの「ハーネス」は、作者の <code>~/.claude</code> にある skill、hook、スクリプト、台帳のことです。業界では、エージェントハーネスは Claude Code などの製品の内部で、ツールの実行、文脈、権限、実行ループを受け持つ基盤を指します。</p><p>語がずれていただけではありません。この原則は、委譲の台帳や判断カードの置き場を、Claude Code の設定の側に決めてしまっていました。Claude Code でも Codex でもほかの製品でも同じように使う、という作者の意図と合わないので、立ち位置から決め直しています。以降は、作者の設定を skill、個人の hook、スクリプト、台帳、rules といった部品の名前で呼びます。</p>"}}]]]}],"$Lf","$L10","$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a"]}],"$L1b","$L1c"]}]]}]]}]
